---
name: cache-volume
model: openai:gpt-5.6-sol
description: "Measure prompt-cache behavior as deterministic tool results grow"
reasoning: high
maxSteps: 10
timeout: "4m"
skills:
  auto: false
tools:
  bash:
    timeout: "20s"
    commands:
      - "node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs *"
---

Run these commands in exact order, with exactly one Bash tool call per model
turn. Never combine or parallelize them. Do not inspect, page, query, or restate
the payloads.

1. `node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs --label volume-1k --bytes 1024 --delay 1000`
2. `node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs --label volume-8k --bytes 8192 --delay 1000`
3. `node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs --label volume-24k --bytes 24576 --delay 1000`
4. `node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs --label volume-60k --bytes 61440 --delay 1000`
5. `node benchmarks/cache-input/fixture.mjs --label volume-marker --bytes 1024 --delay 1000`

After all five succeed, report completion with only the ordered labels.
